IMAP SWE L2 Data
 
 Each line has data from a single measurement for all 7 CEMs.
 Note there are 720 total measurements for each time step, where one time stamp is
   a full cycle consisting of 4 quarter cycles. The time stamp given is the time of
   the first quarter-cycle in each full cycle.
 Each line consists of:
   SHCOARSE (for the first of the 720 measurements only)
   Phase Space Distribution fv (s^3/cm^6) for 7 CEMs for a single energy/spin angle sector
      The 720 energy angle bins are ordered as: Energy 1, Spin sectors 1-30, 
         Energy 2, Spin angles 1-30, Energy 3, Spin sectors 1-30, etc
   NOTE These values are equivalent to phase_space_density_spin_sector or flux_spin_sector
           in the SDC L2 data files
 
